  "postText": "<p><HTML><HEAD><meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\"></HEAD><body></p>\n<div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://dcimg.awalker.jp/v/v8xdohKPCHNlT4v9Xsi77H8XRVMcHXeCSWtIhDC6nIJPoVwIKiZBBBJDZ4xTMdZbiQp2iqMABSueopd6UVwtNHgbYf3bp9Z5j0InUi160rbkBcie3wC7U2vABem2MMYYXeekFgalaXEt6f8OjF7BEIzhxFO1khH0IjaiYRFe3KC7xw0GxFCxX6CKBkdiaj7IJd1SPh7P\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/252/9eafe7b30300ad92c2098e0a581b1dfb..jpg\"></a></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">こさめです！</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">今日は珍しく1日フリーだったのにも関わらず、</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">15時まで睡眠してしまい</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">とても悔しい。</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">正直今から一日が始まる感覚なんだよね～</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">うーん</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">くやしっ‼️</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">絵を描いたり</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">はんじょうの切り抜きみたりして過ごします</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">まだお風呂も入ってない</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">やばすぐる～</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">めんどい～</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">てことで明日は夜最短でお給仕です</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">待っておるよ～</div>\n<div align=\"center\"></div>\n<div align=\"center\"></div>\n<p></body></HTML></p>\n",
